Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.73,0:00:01.85,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.56,0:00:06.48,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(940,1)\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord0\fs20\3c&H444242&\c&H0D1200&\pos(344,145.636)}Monday, July 20th
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.01,0:00:05.27,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Hilarious, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.56,0:00:11.11,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,Hey, Asamura. Head in the clouds? \NHeat getting to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.72,0:00:13.29,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.29,0:00:17.12,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,Anyway, I hear you and Narasaka\Nhave been getting awfully close lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.12,0:00:18.05,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.05,0:00:19.14,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,Haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.61,0:00:22.87,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I just asked her some questions about studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.87,0:00:26.40,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,I hear she goes around \Ncalling you "Big Brother."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:28.93,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh... Yeah, that...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.93,0:00:30.13,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,Well, anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:34.04,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,if you're having a romantic awakening,\Nyou can ask me for advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.04,0:00:39.96,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,As a relationship expert, I'll do everything \NI can to back my buddy up in his love life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.93,0:00:44.64,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,When that time really does come, \NI'll be counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.53,0:02:20.99,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,610)\an1\fnGeorgia\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&H7CC498&\b1\pos(49.5,165.606)}Episode 6 {\fs12}"Sweet 'n' Sour Pork and {\c&H478EBE&}Rain{\c&H7CC498&}"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.54,0:02:22.33,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Asamura-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.31,0:02:27.30,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,What's up? Fancy running into you\Non the way out of here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.30,0:02:29.08,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Narasaka-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.08,0:02:31.18,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, you two are together today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.18,0:02:32.28,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Let's go home together!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.28,0:02:34.88,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh? But... why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:39.58,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Huh? What do you mean, "why"? \NThis is the perfect chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.58,0:02:43.20,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,For what? I have no idea\N what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.20,0:02:46.10,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,I mean, we're all headed to Saki's place!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.10,0:02:46.78,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.93,0:02:53.72,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Sorry. I asked her to help me study at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.72,0:02:55.71,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.04,0:03:00.40,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,But isn't this awkward for Narasaka-san,\Nwith us walking home together?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.40,0:03:03.69,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Not at all! I don't have anything against it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.69,0:03:08.66,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,I mean, you're going to the same place. \NWhy would you walk home separately?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.66,0:03:10.65,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Right, Saki?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.65,0:03:12.67,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Well, you have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.52,0:03:15.07,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.07,0:03:18.08,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Well, I guess we're stuck with it this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.15,0:03:23.10,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Maybe Maaya was the wrong person to ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.68,0:03:25.97,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.97,0:03:27.56,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Uh, this is actually {\i1}my{\i0} house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.56,0:03:29.84,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,First one in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.89,0:03:33.26,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Sorry for all the noise today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:36.06,Main - Top,Maaya,0,0,0,,Hello there, Sofa-kun!\NYou're nice and squishy today!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.95,0:03:37.03,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It won't bother me. Good luck studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.06,0:03:38.75,Main - Top,Maaya,0,0,0,,I'm happy to see you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.78,0:03:38.54,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.75,0:03:42.20,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Wanna do it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.20,0:03:43.89,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Let's go over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.89,0:03:45.95,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll get us something to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.95,0:03:47.24,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.26,0:04:04.20,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Hmm, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.60,0:04:07.82,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.82,0:04:08.48,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.05,0:04:17.22,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,So, here...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.58,0:04:21.76,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry. I'll get started on dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.76,0:04:25.13,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, that's okay. I wasn't trying to pressure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.13,0:04:26.44,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.44,0:04:27.12,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.63,0:04:31.75,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I have the day off from work. \NYou should concentrate on your studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:34.60,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thanks. That's a huge help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:37.72,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Hmm, yes, very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.72,0:04:41.20,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,You're giving off good husband vibes,\N Asamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.62,0:04:54.49,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Maybe I should start with the rice?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.49,0:04:56.85,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Asamura-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.15,0:05:00.00,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,If you want a drink, the fridge is—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:04.16,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,That's not what I'm here for!\NI came to see how you were doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:06.23,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Having a little trouble, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.56,0:05:11.62,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Actually, this is a little\Nembarrassing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.62,0:05:15.14,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I thought I could figure it \Nout if I had a recipe,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.14,0:05:16.87,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,but I can't make any sense of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.17,0:05:18.97,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.54,0:05:24.13,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Hey, Saki! You're good to spend the \Nrest of the time just reviewing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.54,0:05:26.91,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah. Thanks for the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:29.84,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Okay, then, give it your best shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.84,0:05:32.36,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,I'm gonna help Asamura-kun cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.36,0:05:36.72,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Huh? Er, okay... but that's asking a lot of you—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.72,0:05:38.52,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,It's fine, it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.52,0:05:42.29,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,I'll stun you with a taste \Nof my housewifey powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.29,0:05:43.40,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Mwa-ha-ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.57,0:05:46.74,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.40,0:05:49.14,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,All right, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.14,0:05:54.00,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,I'm happy to offer my guidance and support \Nto Big Brother here, our new cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.00,0:05:55.32,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.32,0:05:57.88,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.11,0:06:00.25,Default,kid,0,0,0,,Did you draw it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.89,0:06:03.31,Default,kid,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.50,0:06:03.31,Default,kid,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.64,0:06:06.68,Default,kid,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.68,0:06:08.76,Default,kid,0,0,0,,Ken, ken, pa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.27,0:06:17.64,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,310)\fnArial\fs12\b1\shad0\3c&H40A1BD&\pos(330.133,84.934)\frz352.8}Recipes for Students Studying for Entrance Exams
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.27,0:06:17.77,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,440)\fnArial\fs10\b1\bord1\shad0\3c&HF5F7EB&\c&HA88DBA&\pos(318.4,166.534)\frz353.5}Perfect if you need to count on your body! Handpicked recipes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.77,0:06:20.69,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,111)\fnArial\fs12\b1\shad0\3c&H5DD4F2&\frz352.8\pos(293.333,82.268)}Sweet 'n' Sour Pork
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:22.27,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(290,1)\fnArial\fs8\bord1\shad0\3c&HF7F8EC&\frz352.8\pos(248.533,76.934)\c&H9EA09A&}How to Make
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.64,0:07:54.01,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,So, Asamura-kun, are you sure \Nthere's nothing between you and Saki?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.44,0:07:56.41,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It would be trouble if there was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.41,0:08:00.85,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,But you're basically strangers, right? \NYou aren't even related by blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.85,0:08:03.92,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Why are you so curious about \Nmy relationship with Ayase-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.26,0:08:07.60,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Why? I'm not really sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.20,0:08:12.42,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,I just get this feeling that\N Saki's changed a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.14,0:08:14.60,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.60,0:08:19.24,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Like, for example, she's using \Nmore perfume than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.24,0:08:20.67,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Did you notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.67,0:08:21.66,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.66,0:08:25.70,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Thank goodness! It would've \Nbeen so creepy if you had.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.70,0:08:27.13,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Quit setting traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.13,0:08:32.49,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,And last year, she only used wet wipes \Nwhen she got sweaty instead of perfume.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.49,0:08:38.16,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Those seem to be all she really needs, \Nthough, so it's not like it's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.60,0:08:40.79,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,But she's using more this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.79,0:08:46.30,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Yes! And that's the behavior of a person \Nwho's conscious of a special someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.30,0:08:50.65,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,That's what Detective Maaya-chan's \Nintuition is telling her, Watson-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.65,0:08:51.57,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.57,0:08:53.13,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,What a weak reaction!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.62,0:08:57.78,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Jeez. I'm telling you a super cute girl\Nhas probably got you on her mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.78,0:08:59.95,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,and you don't care at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.95,0:09:04.26,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That's one way to put it, but I think it's\Nonly natural for her to be thinking about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.26,0:09:07.27,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,I knew it! So the feeling's mutual!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.67,0:09:09.52,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.84,0:09:14.83,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,When you live with someone\Nof the opposite sex,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.83,0:09:18.59,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,of course you're going to be \Nmore mindful of the way you smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.59,0:09:21.41,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Huh? Is that all there is to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.41,0:09:27.08,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,But look! She's even watching you right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.99,0:09:36.08,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,She probably realized that \Nwe were talking about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.08,0:09:38.20,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Your voice is pretty loud, Narasaka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.20,0:09:41.81,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Aww. I'm convinced it's one\N of those love things, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.40,0:09:46.78,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,If you keep hounding your friend about that, \Nshe's going to get really annoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.78,0:09:50.49,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Too late! Saki's already \Nreally annoyed with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.72,0:09:54.19,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Oh! Nice timing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.50,0:09:57.94,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,And that's it for Maaya's Cooking Hour today!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.54,0:10:04.45,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,This is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.94,0:10:07.19,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm really glad you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.82,0:10:12.35,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I mean, sweet 'n' sour pork? \NYou really went out of your way for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.59,0:10:16.23,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You might be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.91,0:10:26.01,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thanks. I really do appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.01,0:10:28.98,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Sure. So how's the studying going?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.78,0:10:34.41,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thanks to your help, I was easily able to \Nanswer the questions Maaya came up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.41,0:10:35.93,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.57,0:10:39.08,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But then she got mad because she thinks
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.08,0:10:42.70,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,my study method is roundabout and inefficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.14,0:10:49.94,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah, honestly, it might not be\N the most direct way, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.93,0:11:03.69,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.39,0:11:05.78,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,It's working for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.46,0:11:09.47,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'll do fine on the test tomorrow, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.97,0:11:13.07,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:16.90,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm rooting for you, Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.79,0:11:26.99,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thank you, Asamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.18,0:11:35.23,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.27,0:11:46.20,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Just delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.34,0:11:50.40,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.06,0:12:00.99,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(940,1)\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord0\fs20\3c&H444242&\c&H0D1200&\pos(320,164.836)}Tuesday, July 21st
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.22,0:12:00.99,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,What's up? Something bugging you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.99,0:12:01.88,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.95,0:12:07.08,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, no. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.08,0:12:09.98,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,Yeah? Well, see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.98,0:12:10.64,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.41,0:12:43.53,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.01,0:12:48.65,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,I've never seen my sweet junior\Nso off his game before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.65,0:12:50.54,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.93,0:12:55.91,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm going to head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.75,0:13:05.45,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.73,0:14:13.91,Main - Italics,Caster,0,0,0,,Heavy rain showers hit central Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.18,0:14:18.10,Main - Italics,Caster,0,0,0,,With the rising temperatures and humidity,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.10,0:14:21.11,Main - Italics,Caster,0,0,0,,the rain may be accompanied \Nby lightning in some areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.67,0:14:24.15,Main - Italics,Caster,0,0,0,,The storm may also affect public transit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.00,0:14:28.24,Main - Italics,Caster,0,0,0,,Heavy precipitation is expected \Nto continue late into the evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.45,0:14:33.62,Main - Italics,Reporter,0,0,0,,This is the current situation \Nhere in Shibuya, Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.62,0:14:37.23,Main - Italics,Reporter,0,0,0,,Large raindrops are pounding \Ndown upon the pavement.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.23,0:14:41.64,Main - Italics,Reporter,0,0,0,,Some station platforms and retail \Nfacilities are experiencing flooding,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.64,0:14:43.19,Main - Italics,Reporter,0,0,0,,resulting in widespread chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.61,0:14:49.70,Main - Italics,Reporter,0,0,0,,It's rush hour right now, and the trains \Nare absolutely packed with passengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:51.74,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord2\blur2\fs16\3c&HFEFAEA&\c&HB3AA93&\pos(320,300)\b1}Tutor me in modern lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.74,0:14:53.74,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord2\blur2\fs16\3c&HFEFAEA&\c&HB3AA93&\pos(320,300)\b1}Thank you. You're a really good teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:55.99,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord2\blur2\fs16\3c&HFEFAEA&\c&HB3AA93&\pos(320,300)\b1}I'll try listening to it tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.75,0:14:59.39,Main - Top + Italics,Reporter,0,0,0,,Stations are restricting access to platforms,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.50,0:14:58.77,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord0\fs16\3c&HFEFAEA&\c&H6571B4&\pos(324,290)\b1}You {\alpha&FF&}okay in the rain?
