Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:49.05,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs8\fnArial\shad0\fax.15\c&H7E8B87&\3c&HF1FEF4&\pos(226.858,112.285)\frz8.343}How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:49.05,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an3\fs8\fnArial\shad0\fax.15\c&H7E8B87&\3c&HE1FFEA&\pos(361.715,125.428)\frz9.714}It went fine
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:49.05,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs8\fnArial\shad0\fax.15\c&H7E8B87&\3c&HF1FEF4&\frz9\pos(255.429,189.999)}Thanks
