Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:49.05,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an3\fs8\fnArial\shad0\fax.1\c&H7E8B87&\3c&HD1FBCF&\frz12.99\pos(432.572,252.285)}Where are you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.75,0:16:03.11,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I'll trust in you and do my best, Asamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.15,0:16:36.68,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, I'm sorry! You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.52,0:16:41.60,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Asamura-kun? Are you going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.03,0:16:45.44,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Uh... No, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.94,0:16:53.84,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You were late, and it was raining so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.31,0:16:57.44,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I couldn't get a hold of you, so I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.46,0:17:04.71,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I was worried maybe the test didn't go great \Nand you were off... crying somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.20,0:17:10.79,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You must have really been worried.\NI'm genuinely sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.62,0:17:13.37,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But as for the test...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.04,0:17:19.32,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Well, to be honest, \NI didn't exactly get the best result.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.98,0:17:28.48,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fax-.1\fay-.2\fs10\shad0\bord1\c&H484F50&\frz14.26\3c&HCBD6D7&\pos(129.335,287.335)}Q2
