Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.81,0:17:27.64,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,But that's a passing score...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.25,0:17:35.21,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Asamura-kun, you got 96 points, right? \NI didn't beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.50,0:17:37.67,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,It's so frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.33,0:17:42.12,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Don't scare me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.49,0:17:45.31,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Sorry to make you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.46,0:17:49.38,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I also went somewhere different for groceries.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.44,0:17:52.71,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Did you go all the way to the department store?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.49,0:17:57.14,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Did you want to celebrate passing\Nthe test with something special?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.56,0:18:00.76,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,That's half right and half not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.12,0:18:03.58,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Can I get a practice answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:07.05,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I wanted to show my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.79,0:18:12.92,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I know that might sound \Nkind of condescending,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.68,0:18:15.79,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,but I really mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:18.82,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I haven't done anything to earn your gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.23,0:18:21.38,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,We made a fair exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.38,0:18:25.76,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,No. You did so much for me\Nleading up to the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.05,0:18:27.66,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You introduced me to new music,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.11,0:18:30.81,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,taught me how to read modern literature...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.81,0:18:33.04,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That isn't exactly a whole lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.56,0:18:36.06,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,And yesterday, you even made me dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.53,0:18:41.08,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Compared to all the cooking \Nyou've done for over a month,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.08,0:18:43.71,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I don't think one dinner comes close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.43,0:18:48.94,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Like I said, I like to give more than I take.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.67,0:18:55.02,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,So today, I'm going to make you\Nthe most elegant meal I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.82,0:19:02.28,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Or do you feel like you can only\Nlean on someone older than you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.28,0:19:02.95,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.03,0:19:06.63,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You mean Yomiuri-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.19,0:19:09.21,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,What's she got to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.98,0:19:17.00,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,As far as I know, she's the one and only \Nperson you really trust to have your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.98,0:19:22.97,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Well, that's just because\N we work together so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.20,0:19:28.98,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You can depend on me, too.\NJust like you depend on her at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.51,0:19:32.59,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I want you to depend on me for stuff at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.42,0:19:39.71,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Or we can just say your little sister is really\Nstubborn. Will you go along with it then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.61,0:19:49.27,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Speaking as your big brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.27,0:19:53.92,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,if I let you treat me today, \Nwould you consider that mission success?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.40,0:19:58.50,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yes. That would make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.70,0:20:09.93,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,How long are we going \Nto stay in here, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.49,0:20:12.98,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You're right. Let's get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.50,0:20:14.23,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.70,0:20:23.73,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,By the way, can I ask you one more thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.73,0:20:24.58,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.10,0:20:27.82,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I messaged you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.29,0:20:29.93,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh, about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.21,0:20:35.61,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I keep running down my phone battery\Nlistening to that music you sent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.92,0:20:41.57,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs18\shad0\bord0\fay-.11\c&H35413F&\pos(402.667,158)\fad(1,1585)}Asamura\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hAyase
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.43,0:20:39.06,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ah, that explains it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.59,0:20:47.55,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(940,1)\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord0\fs20\3c&H444242&\c&HFEFDFD&\pos(210,253.2)}Wednesday, July 22nd
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.42,0:20:50.67,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,So, uh, summer vacation starts tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.67,0:20:52.74,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Don't go too crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.74,0:20:56.03,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.03,0:20:58.00,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah. See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:20:59.34,Default,Students,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.01,0:21:02.02,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.02,0:21:04.54,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,Oh, you're sure in a rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.54,0:21:06.09,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I gotta get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.51,0:21:09.60,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,Looks like you're over \Nwhatever was bothering you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.18,0:21:14.12,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.53,0:21:15.41,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.41,0:21:16.41,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.41,0:21:18.23,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,Work hard, young man!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.42,0:21:33.15,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.97,0:21:42.59,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Asamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.59,0:21:46.39,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,If you're tired, don't push yourself. \NTake a little break.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.39,0:21:50.63,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Boss, who was that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.06,0:21:54.84,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Oh, she's here for a job interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.99,0:21:57.38,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,What's her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.38,0:21:58.14,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.88,0:22:02.00,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Oh, her name is Ayase Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.52,0:23:50.03,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&HA399ED&\b1\pos(320,162.606)}Episode 7 {\fs14}"Feelings and {\c&HD4D29F&}Summer {\c&HA399ED&}Vacation"
